s=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.033ex\" height=\"2.832ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -789.7 3992.6 1251.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1623,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2678.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(355.3,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"795.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3714.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where</p>\n\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.044ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1345.2 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the electric flux,</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.041ex\" height=\"1.439ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 460 636\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the electric charge,</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.906ex\" height=\"1.35ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 842.6 596.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the permittivity of free space.</p></p>\n\n<p>To find the dimensions of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.89ex\" height=\"2.918ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -936.8 2603.6 1289.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<p><p>Differentiate Gauss\u2019s law with respect to time:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.542ex\" height=\"3.235ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -967.9 5543.5 1430\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2038.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3094.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(341.1,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"795.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4130.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(255,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"895.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5265.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n<p><p>Multiply the equation by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.906ex\" height=\"1.35ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 842.6 596.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.105ex\" height=\"2.988ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -967.9 5350.2 1320.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2881.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3937.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(255,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"895.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5072.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n<p><p>Recognize that the time rate of change of charge, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.568ex\" height=\"2.988ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -967.9 1135.1 1320.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(255,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"895.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is by definition the electric current.</p></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the dimensions of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.89ex\" height=\"2.918ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -936.8 2603.6 1289.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are those of electric current.</p>\n<p>The correct answer is: Option C, electric current.</p>","qKey":"m9e5j7lj","paperKey":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main","questions":[{"question_id":"m9e5j7lj","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift","year":2025,"subject":"physics","chapter":"electrostatics","chapterGroup":"electricity","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.906ex\" height=\"1.35ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 842.6 596.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> denotes the permittivity of free space and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.044ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1345.2 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the flux of the electric field through the area bounded by the closed surface, then dimensions of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.469ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.39ex\" height=\"4.07ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1149.5 3708.5 1799\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(597,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1439.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,485) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D719\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D719\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(629,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(523.4,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1431.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3111.5,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-29\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are that of :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":" electric charge\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":" electric field\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":" electric current\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":" electric potential"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>We can use Gauss\u2019s law to analyze the dimensions. Gauss\u2019s law states that</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.033ex\" height=\"2.832ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -789.7 3992.6 1251.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1623,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2678.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(355.3,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"795.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3714.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where</p>\n\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.044ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1345.2 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the electric flux,</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.041ex\" height=\"1.439ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 460 636\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the electric charge,</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.906ex\" height=\"1.35ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 842.6 596.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the permittivity of free space.</p></p>\n\n<p>To find the dimensions of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.89ex\" height=\"2.918ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -936.8 2603.6 1289.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, follow these steps:</p>\n\n<p><p>Differentiate Gauss\u2019s law with respect to time:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.045ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.542ex\" height=\"3.235ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -967.9 5543.5 1430\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2038.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3094.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(341.1,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"795.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4130.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(255,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"895.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5265.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n<p><p>Multiply the equation by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.906ex\" height=\"1.35ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 842.6 596.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.105ex\" height=\"2.988ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -967.9 5350.2 1320.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2881.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3937.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(255,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"895.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5072.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></p>\n<p><p>Recognize that the time rate of change of charge, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.568ex\" height=\"2.988ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -967.9 1135.1 1320.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(255,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"895.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is by definition the electric current.</p></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the dimensions of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.89ex\" height=\"2.918ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -936.8 2603.6 1289.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"3A6\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A6\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(568,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1521\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are those of electric current.</p>\n<p>The correct answer is: Option C, electric current.</p>","qKey":"m9e5j7lj","paperKey":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}